{"assets":["/statement-assets/e7ebd2808c5c51cec30f2c6330fabd8ab1565f1aba82d5a5cccd505208e81f92.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"198","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Delivering Carcinogen"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Qwerty the Ranger arrived to the Diatar system with a very important task. He should deliver a special carcinogen for scientific research to planet Persephone. This is urgent, so Qwerty has to get to the planet as soon as possible. A lost day may fail negotiations as nobody is going to pay for an overdue carcinogen."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can consider Qwerty's ship, the planet Persephone and the star Diatar points on a plane. Diatar is located in the origin of coordinate axes — at point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Persephone goes round Diatar along a circular orbit with radius "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the counter-clockwise direction at constant linear speed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vp"},{"kind":"text","text":" (thus, for instance, a full circle around the star takes "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/e7ebd2808c5c51cec30f2c6330fabd8ab1565f1aba82d5a5cccd505208e81f92.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" of time). At the initial moment of time Persephone is located at point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(xp, yp)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At the initial moment of time Qwerty's ship is at point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x, y)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Qwerty can move in any direction at speed of at most "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v > vp"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The star Diatar is hot (as all stars), so Qwerty can't get too close to it. The ship's metal sheathing melts at distance "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r < R"},{"kind":"text","text":") from the star."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum time Qwerty needs to get the carcinogen to planet Persephone."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xp"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yp"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vp"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 104 ≤ xp, yp ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ vp < 104"},{"kind":"text","text":") — Persephone's initial position and the speed at which it goes round Diatar."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 104 ≤ x, y ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 < v ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ r ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":") — The intial position of Qwerty's ship, its maximum speed and the minimum safe distance to star Diatar."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r2 < x2 + y2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r2 < xp2 + yp2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vp < v"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single real number — the minimum possible delivery time. The answer will be considered valid if its absolute or relative error does not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 - 6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 0 1\n-10 0 2 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9.584544103"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"50 60 10\n50 60 20 40\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0.000000000"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"198C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/198/problem/C"}